{#- Count Patchula's CLI reference page: usage's spec template, with Starlight
    front matter in place of the top-level heading. mise run docs:cli drops the
    comment usage puts before it, since front matter must come first. -#}
---
title: CLI commands
description: Every patchula command, argument and flag, generated from the CLI's usage spec.
---

<!-- Generated by `mise run docs:cli` from the usage spec. Do not edit. -->
